---
layout: layouts/poster.njk
pagination:
  data: flyerLangs
  size: 1
  alias: plang
  addAllPagesToCollections: true
flyerLangs: ["en", "es"]
permalink: "{% if plang == 'es' %}/es{% endif %}/flyer/"
translated: true
schema: event
titleFonts: true
eleventyComputed:
  lang: "{{ plang }}"
  title: "{{ pagecopy.flyer[plang].meta.title | tokens | safe }}"
  description: "{{ pagecopy.flyer[plang].meta.description | tokens | safe }}"
---
{#- Flyer & poster, /flyer/ and /es/flyer/: the two things to spread the word with, on one page.
    The hero names both and links to each part (#official-flyer, #printable-poster, #flyer-text).
    1. THE OFFICIAL FLYER (#official-flyer; the flyer itself is in English): the image, large; beside it
       (after it on phones) its downloads and the share buttons; and the flyer's full text, built from
       site.json + when.js so it never disagrees with How to join, in a collapsed <details> (under the image
       on wide screens, last on phones) that a link to #flyer-text opens.
       Files and sizes: site.json → flyer; on /es/flyer/ the sizes get a decimal comma ("1,4 MB"), as the
       poster's panel writes "8,5 × 11 pulgadas". When the Zoom details the flyer prints (flyer.zoomMeetingId
       / zoomPasscode / zoomJoinUrl) differ from event.zoom, a warning sends people to How to join.
    2. THE PRINTABLE POSTER (#printable-poster; the Spanish one is the only Spanish printable): a panel to print
       or download it, and a preview that scales with the screen. The flyer's brand on a light, low-ink background.
    On paper (Ctrl+P or the Print button) the page is the poster alone, on one Letter sheet: layouts/poster.njk
    sets the @page and html.poster-page, and poster.css hides everything else. The flyer prints from its PDF.
    CONTRACT with scripts/pdf.mjs, which renders this page to brand/poster/ (Letter + A4 PDF, 300-dpi PNG):
    keep the element id="poster"; at a 900 px-wide screen it must be exactly 8.5 in (816 px) wide, untransformed
    (the PNG is a screenshot of it); :root[data-size="a4"] switches it to A4 for the A4 PDF.
    Every size inside the poster is in cqw (1% of its width), so the preview, the PDFs and the PNG match.
    The questions address is printed on the poster as well as in the footer; the flyer's text links to it.
    Copy: src/_data/pagecopy/flyer.json (c; the poster's: c.poster) and i18n (t).
    Styles: src/assets/css/pages/flyer.css and poster.css. -#}
{% set c = pagecopy.flyer[lang] %}
{% set pc = c.poster %}
{% set es = lang == "es" %}
{% set p = "/es" if es else "" %}
{% set suffix = "-es" if es else "" %}
{% set fl = site.flyer %}
{% set z = site.event.zoom %}
{% set stale = (fl.zoomMeetingId and fl.zoomMeetingId != z.meetingId) or (fl.zoomPasscode and fl.zoomPasscode != z.passcode) or (fl.zoomJoinUrl and fl.zoomJoinUrl != z.joinUrl) %}
{% set webp = [] %}{% set jpg = [] %}
{% for w in fl.widths or [600, 1000, 1600] %}{% set _ = webp.push(fl.base + "-" + w + ".webp " + w + "w") %}{% set _ = jpg.push(fl.base + "-" + w + ".jpg " + w + "w") %}{% endfor %}
{% set sizes = "(min-width: 74rem) 38rem, (min-width: 60rem) calc(100vw - 30rem), (min-width: 38rem) 36rem, calc(100vw - 2rem)" %}
{% set pdfMeta = c.downloads.pdfMeta | tokens %}{% set jpgMeta = c.downloads.jpgMeta | tokens %}
{% if es %}{% set pdfMeta = pdfMeta | replace(r/(\d)\.(\d)/g, "$1,$2") %}{% set jpgMeta = jpgMeta | replace(r/(\d)\.(\d)/g, "$1,$2") %}{% endif %}

{#- The page's three parts, as links under the hero's lead (the #flyer-text link also opens that box). -#}
{% set jump %}
<nav class="page-hero-meta flyer-jump" aria-label="{{ c.jump.label }}">
  <ul class="chip-row">
    <li><a href="#official-flyer" class="chip">{% icon "image", "icon icon-sm" %}<span>{{ c.jump.flyer }}</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#printable-poster" class="chip">{% icon "printer", "icon icon-sm" %}<span>{{ c.jump.poster }}</span></a></li>
    <li><a href="#flyer-text" class="chip">{% icon "file-text", "icon icon-sm" %}<span>{{ c.jump.text }}</span></a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>
{% endset %}
{% set hero = { eyebrow: c.hero.eyebrow, title: c.hero.title, lead: c.hero.lead | tokens, crumbLabel: c.hero.crumb, after: jump } %}
{% include "partials/page-hero.njk" %}

{# ============ 1. THE OFFICIAL FLYER ============ #}
<section class="section-tight" id="official-flyer" aria-labelledby="official-flyer-title">
  <div class="container-page flyer-layout">
    <div class="section-head flyer-head">
      <h2 class="h-section" id="official-flyer-title">{{ c.flyer.heading }}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="flyer-top">
      {% if c.englishNote %}
      <div class="notice">
        {% icon "languages", "icon" %}
        <p>{{ c.englishNote | tokens | mdInline | safe }}</p>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
      {% if stale %}
      <div class="notice flyer-stale" role="note">
        {% icon "triangle-alert", "icon" %}
        <p><strong>{{ c.stale.text | tokens }}</strong> <a href="{{ p }}/join/">{{ c.stale.link }}</a></p>
      </div>
      {% endif %}

      <figure class="flyer-figure">
        <a href="{{ fl.jpg }}" class="flyer-frame">
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="{{ webp | join(', ') }}" sizes="{{ sizes }}">
            <img src="{{ fl.base }}-{{ fl.width }}.jpg" srcset="{{ jpg | join(', ') }}" sizes="{{ sizes }}" width="{{ fl.width }}" height="{{ fl.height }}" alt="{{ c.image.alt | tokens | plain }}" loading="eager" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
          </picture>
          <span class="flyer-zoom" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "maximize-2", "icon icon-sm" %}</span>
        </a>
        <figcaption class="flyer-caption">{{ c.image.caption | tokens }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="flyer-aside">
      <section class="card flyer-card" aria-labelledby="flyer-dl-title">
        <h3 class="h-card" id="flyer-dl-title">{{ c.downloads.heading }}</h3>
        <ul class="dl-list">
          <li><a class="dl-item dl-item--primary" href="{{ fl.pdf }}" download type="application/pdf">
            <span class="dl-icon">{% icon "file-down", "icon" %}</span>
            <span class="dl-text"><span class="dl-title">{{ c.downloads.pdf }}</span><span class="dl-meta">{{ pdfMeta }}</span></span>
            {% icon "download", "icon dl-go" %}</a></li>
          {% if fl.jpg %}<li><a class="dl-item" href="{{ fl.jpg }}" download type="image/jpeg">
            <span class="dl-icon">{% icon "image", "icon" %}</span>
            <span class="dl-text"><span class="dl-title">{{ c.downloads.jpg }}</span><span class="dl-meta">{{ jpgMeta }}</span></span>
            {% icon "download", "icon dl-go" %}</a></li>{% endif %}
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="card flyer-card" aria-labelledby="flyer-share-title">
        <h3 class="h-card" id="flyer-share-title">{{ c.share.heading }}</h3>
        <div class="mt-4">{% set sharePath = p + "/flyer/" %}{% include "partials/share.njk" %}</div>
      </section>
    </div>

    {# The flyer's full text, for screen readers, translation tools and search. #}
    <details class="flyer-text" id="flyer-text">
      <summary>
        <span class="flyer-text-icon">{% icon "file-text", "icon" %}</span>
        <h3 class="flyer-text-heading">{{ c.text.summary }}</h3>
        <span class="flyer-text-hint">{{ c.text.hint }}</span>
        {% icon "chevron-down", "icon chev" %}
      </summary>
      <div class="flyer-text-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ c.text.overline | tokens }}</p>
        <p class="flyer-text-title"{% if es %} lang="en"{% endif %}>{{ c.text.title | tokens }}</p>
        <p class="flyer-text-subline">{{ c.text.subline | tokens }}</p>
        <p class="flyer-text-when">
          <strong><time datetime="{{ when.date.iso }}">{{ (when.date.longEs | capitalize) if es else when.date.long }}</time></strong>
          <span>{{ when.time.leadEs if es else when.time.lead }}</span>
          <span class="text-muted">{{ when.time.startsAlsoEs if es else when.time.startsAlso }}</span>
        </p>
        <p>{{ c.text.body | tokens | mdInline | safe }}</p>
        <p class="flyer-text-strands">{{ c.text.strands | tokens }}<br>{{ c.text.burst | tokens }}</p>
        <p>{{ c.text.cost | tokens }}</p>
        <dl class="flyer-text-zoom">
          <div><dt>{{ c.text.zoomId }}</dt><dd class="font-mono">{{ z.meetingId | nbsp }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{{ c.text.passcode }}</dt><dd class="font-mono">{{ z.passcode }}</dd></div>
          <div><dt>{{ c.text.link }}</dt><dd><a href="{{ z.joinUrl }}" class="flyer-text-url" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ z.joinUrl }}<span class="sr-only"> {{ t.a11y.openInNewTab }}</span></a></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>{{ c.text.program | tokens }} <a href="{{ p }}/program/">{{ c.text.programLink }}</a></p>
        {% if site.contact.email %}<p>{{ c.text.questions }} <a href="{{ site.contact.email | mailto(t.contact.subject | tokens) }}">{{ t.contact.linkText }}</a></p>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </details>
    {#- Opens the flyer's text when a link points to it (#flyer-text: the hero's link, the Spanish note above,
        or a shared link), as faq.njk does for its questions. The click handler opens the box before the
        browser scrolls to it (and covers a repeat click while the hash is already #flyer-text, which fires no
        hashchange), so the visitor lands on its top with the text below. Arriving with the hash, the browser
        has already jumped to the box; once app.js has run (it can unhide the Share button above, pushing the
        box down on a slow connection) the box is put back under the header, instantly, as it is a correction
        of a few pixels. Without JavaScript the box simply opens when tapped. #}
    <script>
    (() => {
      const d = document.getElementById("flyer-text");
      if (!d) return;
      const here = () => location.hash === "#flyer-text";
      if (here()) {
        d.open = true;
        document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          if (!here()) return;
          try { d.scrollIntoView({ block: "start", behavior: "instant" }); } catch (_) { d.scrollIntoView(true); }
        }));
      }
      addEventListener("hashchange", () => { if (here()) d.open = true; });
      document.addEventListener("click", (e) => {
        if (e.target.closest && e.target.closest('a[href="#flyer-text"]')) d.open = true;
      });
    })();
    </script>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============ 2. THE PRINTABLE POSTER (the old /poster/ and /es/poster/ forward here: redirects.njk) ============ #}
<section class="section-tight poster-stage" id="printable-poster" aria-labelledby="printable-poster-title">
  <div class="container-page poster-layout">
    <div class="section-head poster-stage-head">
      <h2 class="h-section" id="printable-poster-title">{{ pc.heading }}</h2>
      <p class="lead">{{ pc.lead | tokens }}</p>
    </div>

    <div class="poster-panel">
      <section class="card" aria-labelledby="poster-panel-title">
        <h3 class="h-card" id="poster-panel-title">{{ pc.panel.heading }}</h3>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-block mt-4" data-print hidden>{% icon "printer", "icon" %}<span>{{ pc.panel.print }}</span></button>
        <script>(function () { var b = document.querySelector("[data-print]"); if (b && window.print) { b.hidden = false; b.addEventListener("click", function () { window.print(); }); } })();</script>
        <ul class="dl-list">
          <li><a class="dl-item" href="/brand/poster/aatapestry-poster{{ suffix }}-letter.pdf" download type="application/pdf">
            <span class="dl-icon">{% icon "file-down", "icon" %}</span>
            <span class="dl-text"><span class="dl-title">{{ pc.panel.letter }}</span><span class="dl-meta">{{ pc.panel.letterMeta }}</span></span>
            {% icon "download", "icon dl-go" %}</a></li>
          <li><a class="dl-item" href="/brand/poster/aatapestry-poster{{ suffix }}-a4.pdf" download type="application/pdf">
            <span class="dl-icon">{% icon "file-down", "icon" %}</span>
            <span class="dl-text"><span class="dl-title">{{ pc.panel.a4 }}</span><span class="dl-meta">{{ pc.panel.a4Meta }}</span></span>
            {% icon "download", "icon dl-go" %}</a></li>
          <li><a class="dl-item" href="/brand/poster/aatapestry-poster{{ suffix }}.png" download type="image/png">
            <span class="dl-icon">{% icon "image", "icon" %}</span>
            <span class="dl-text"><span class="dl-title">{{ pc.panel.png }}</span><span class="dl-meta">{{ pc.panel.pngMeta }}</span></span>
            {% icon "download", "icon dl-go" %}</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="poster-tip">{% icon "info", "icon icon-sm" %}<span>{{ pc.panel.tip }}</span></p>
      </section>
      <ul class="poster-links">
        <li><a href="{{ '/flyer/' if es else '/es/flyer/' }}#printable-poster" class="link-arrow" lang="{{ otherLang }}" hreflang="{{ otherLang }}">{% icon "languages", "icon icon-sm" %}<span>{{ pc.panel.other }}</span></a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="poster-preview">
      <h3 class="eyebrow poster-preview-label" id="poster-preview-title">{{ pc.panel.preview }}</h3>

      {# ===== The poster ===== #}
      {% set s = pc.sheet %}
      <div class="poster{% if es %} poster--es{% endif %}" id="poster">
        <div class="poster-weave" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="poster-inner">
          <div class="poster-head">
            {% inlineSvg "brand/logo/mark.svg", "poster-logo" %}
            <div class="poster-title-wrap">
              <h4 class="poster-title"{% if es %} lang="en"{% endif %}>
                <span class="lockup">
                  <span class="lockup-the poster-gold">{{ s.the }}</span>
                  <span class="lockup-incredible poster-gold">{{ s.incredible }}</span>
                  <span class="lockup-tapestry">{{ s.tapestry }}</span>
                </span>
              </h4>
              {% inlineSvg "src/assets/img/braid.svg", "poster-braid" %}
              {% if t.landing.gloss %}<p class="poster-gloss">{{ t.landing.gloss }}</p>{% endif %}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="poster-intro">
            <p class="poster-overline">{{ t.landing.eyebrow }}</p>
            <p class="poster-subline">{{ t.landing.subline }}</p>
          </div>

          <p class="date-ribbon poster-date"><time datetime="{{ when.date.iso }}">{{ (when.date.longEs | capitalize) if es else when.date.long }}</time></p>

          <div class="poster-time">
            <p class="poster-time-main">{{ when.time.leadEs if es else when.time.lead }}</p>
            <div class="poster-time-zones">
              {% for a in when.also %}<p><span>{{ a.startEs if es else a.start }}</span>&nbsp;<b>{{ a.short }}</b></p>{% endfor %}
            </div>
          </div>

          {% set strandIcons = { "recovery": "book-open", "unity": "users", "service": "network" } %}
          {% set strandKeys = { "recovery": "stepsShort", "unity": "traditionsShort", "service": "conceptsShort" } %}
          <ul class="poster-strands">
            {% for l in site.legacies %}
            <li class="poster-strand" data-legacy="{{ l.key }}">
              <span class="poster-strand-icon">{% icon strandIcons[l.key], "icon" %}</span>
              <span><span class="poster-strand-name">{{ t.legacies[strandKeys[l.key]] }}</span><span class="poster-strand-legacy">{{ t.legacies[l.key] }}</span></span>
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>

          <div class="poster-zoom">
            <div>
              <p class="poster-zoom-head"><span class="poster-zoom-badge">{% icon "video", "icon" %}</span><span>{{ t.labels.online }}</span></p>
              <dl class="poster-ids">
                <div><dt>{{ t.labels.meetingId }}</dt><dd>{{ z.meetingId | nbsp }}</dd></div>
                <div><dt>{{ t.labels.passcode }}</dt><dd>{{ z.passcode }}</dd></div>
              </dl>
            </div>
            <figure class="poster-qr">{% inlineSvg "brand/qr/qr-zoom.svg", "poster-qr-code" %}<figcaption>{{ s.scanZoom }}</figcaption></figure>
            <figure class="poster-qr">{% inlineSvg "brand/qr/qr-site" + suffix + ".svg", "poster-qr-code" %}<figcaption>{{ s.scanSite }}</figcaption></figure>
          </div>

          <ul class="poster-facts">
            <li class="poster-fact" data-legacy="service"><span class="poster-fact-icon">{% icon "heart-handshake", "icon" %}</span><span><b>{{ t.labels.free }}</b><span>{{ s.freeSub }}</span></span></li>
            <li class="poster-fact" data-legacy="unity"><span class="poster-fact-icon">{% icon "circle-check", "icon" %}</span><span><b>{{ t.labels.noRegistration }}</b><span>{{ s.registrationSub }}</span></span></li>
            <li class="poster-fact" data-legacy="recovery"><span class="poster-fact-icon">{% icon "languages", "icon" %}</span><span><b>{{ s.interpretation }}</b><span>{{ s.interpretationSub }}</span></span></li>
          </ul>

          {% if site.contact.email %}<p class="poster-ask">{% icon "mail", "icon" %}<span>{{ t.contact.body }}</span> <b>{{ site.contact.email }}</b></p>{% endif %}

          <div class="poster-foot">
            <p class="poster-fine">{{ s.fine }}</p>
            <p class="poster-url">{{ site.domain }}{{ "/es" if es }}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
